  "description": "REA McGee are delighted to present this exceptional 3 bed detached bungalow to the letting market located in one of Dublin 's most sought after locations. This peaceful and idyllic property comes with an abundance of parking .  \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises three double bedrooms, a main bathroom, a bright and spacious living room, and an open-plan kitchen and dining area.\n\nTucked away in the peaceful and highly sought after Bohernabreena, at the foot of the picturesque Dublin Mountains, this property is within close proximity to many amenities. The Old Mill & Old Bawn Shopping Centre are within a 5 minute drive. Tallaght Village & The Square Town Centre which host an abundance of shops, restauranats and amenities alongside Tallaght Hospital, TUD Tallaght are only within a 10 minute drive. Easy access to M50 & N7 road networks.",
